!!! A 'context' annotation inside a paragraph body.
!!!
!!! A binding is code, not a declaration: nothing in the artifact corresponds
!!! to it, so there is nowhere to put an annotation for it. The book-level
!!! refusals name the word the author wrote and say where one can go. In
!!! statement position the parser used to reach its generic "expected a
!!! statement" message instead, whose help lists statement keywords and never
!!! mentions 'context' at all -- the wrong lesson for someone whose actual
!!! mistake was annotating a local value.
book diagnostic.context-on-a-statement

main returns number begin paragraph
    context "How wide the screen is."
    value screen-width is 1920
    say screen-width
    give 0
end paragraph
